<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S1.T2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>. </span><span id="S1.T2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Levels of code portability and their implementations. Libraries like MPI can be shipped with a container and replaced dynamically at runtime or fully mounted inside the container during execution, as long as ABI compatibility is provided.</span></figcaption>
