<span id="S1.T2.5.1.1.1.1.1.1.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">Runtime JIT compilation</span>
<span id="S1.T2.5.1.1.1.1.1.1.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">Virtual GPU architecture</span>
